Package: qore-python-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Provides: python3-qore
Suggests: qore-python-module-doc
Description: bidirectional Qore and Python integration
 This module allows Qore programs to call Python and Python programs to
 import Qore APIs through qoreloader. It supports cross-language classes,
 conversions, callbacks and exceptions. Native compiler metadata is included.
 The extension is built for the distribution's default Python minor version.

Package: qore-python-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-python-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's Python integration
 This package contains the HTML API reference and test/example programs
 for the bidirectional Qore and Python integration module.
